  "proves": "A positional argument binds to `value`, an explicit keyword binds to `factor`, and `offset=5` -- which matches no declared parameter -- lands inside **options under the key `offset`. The return value flows back to the caller's local. Losing the **options key means losing the only path from the call site to `options[\\'offset\\']`.",
